WEBVTT

00:14.688 --> 00:17.858
Yomiko! Don't die! Stay with me!

00:21.403 --> 00:25.907
Yomiko! You can't die.
Don't die on me! Hey.

00:32.748 --> 00:34.750
SURGERY IN PROGRESS

00:34.833 --> 00:37.586
A human made up entirely of vines…

00:37.669 --> 00:41.173
Is it even possible to move
once you're a full-fledged Spiriflor?

00:41.256 --> 00:43.300
In the Transfloration process,

00:43.383 --> 00:47.554
the body's slowly eaten away from
the inside as the Spiriflor's growing.

00:47.637 --> 00:50.182
So once that starts,
you stop being able to move.

00:50.265 --> 00:53.935
But, what did it attack Yomiko for?

01:04.529 --> 01:06.073
We were able to save her.

01:07.157 --> 01:09.826
She should wake up
once she's had time to recover.

01:11.078 --> 01:12.579
Hmm.

01:12.662 --> 01:15.373
However, her internal damage was severe.

01:15.457 --> 01:19.836
If her condition doesn't improve,
removing her stomach may be necessary.

01:21.797 --> 01:25.842
That would mean that she won't be able
to eat like she used to.

01:28.678 --> 01:29.846
Hang on!

01:33.225 --> 01:34.267
Wait a minute.

01:35.060 --> 01:36.228
Where the hell are you going?

01:36.311 --> 01:37.979
To murder whoever did this.

01:38.063 --> 01:39.564
Right before it stabbed her,

01:39.648 --> 01:41.775
I heard it's bloodlust.

01:41.858 --> 01:42.943
If I can find that voice--

01:43.026 --> 01:44.319
You will be killed.

01:45.320 --> 01:47.322
Look, I understand how you feel.

01:47.405 --> 01:49.449
But you have two years left.

01:49.533 --> 01:51.868
You really want to waste
that time on revenge?

01:53.662 --> 01:56.957
Yomiko, she might not be able
to eat anymore.

01:58.041 --> 01:59.835
<i>She may not ever smile again.</i>

02:03.213 --> 02:04.714
It's not fair.

02:04.840 --> 02:05.841
I won't stand by.

02:06.675 --> 02:08.426
For me, two years is nothing.

02:09.553 --> 02:11.096
Hmm.

02:12.180 --> 02:13.515
You can't do it alone.

02:14.266 --> 02:16.810
There have been
a series of murders in the area.

02:16.893 --> 02:18.812
The police requested her help,

02:18.895 --> 02:21.481
so Yomiko has been assisting
with the investigation.

02:22.065 --> 02:24.568
I'm going to recommend you
as her replacement.

02:26.153 --> 02:28.613
- I'll do my best.
- But listen to me.

02:29.823 --> 02:32.534
That power of yours
has to be kept a secret, all right?

02:32.617 --> 02:33.827
You can't tell them.

02:33.910 --> 02:35.495
The cops or Transflora Medical.

02:35.579 --> 02:36.705
Huh?

02:36.788 --> 02:39.291
You're not a normal Transfloration case.

02:39.374 --> 02:42.210
Every damn person
will want to use you if they find out.

02:43.461 --> 02:45.380
Toshiro you need to understand.

02:45.463 --> 02:48.133
Everyone involved in this case
has their own agenda.

02:48.216 --> 02:49.384
So watch out.

02:49.467 --> 02:51.052
It's for your own protection.

03:01.062 --> 03:04.983
Excuse me, you're Toshiro Kamiya,
the new Special Investigator, right?

03:05.066 --> 03:06.610
Sorry for the wait.

03:06.693 --> 03:08.528
Headquarters wants us to come in.

03:10.739 --> 03:12.991
Is this guy really
the replacement for Yomiko?

03:16.870 --> 03:20.207
Stop looking at me
with that dumb face, you brat.

03:20.290 --> 03:21.958
Akira.

03:22.042 --> 03:23.835
It takes one to know one, right?

03:27.839 --> 03:30.217
How about some introductions
before you start fighting?

03:31.301 --> 03:33.178
My name is Yo Kunibe.

03:33.261 --> 03:37.599
I'm in PR for the Spiriflora Division
at Transflora Medical Number 4.

03:37.682 --> 03:40.894
Next to me
is another Special Investigator.

03:41.311 --> 03:44.731
Akira Yatsuka, I'm Deputy Chief of HR.

03:44.814 --> 03:46.566
Uh, right.

03:46.650 --> 03:48.026
Toshiro Kamiya.

03:48.109 --> 03:50.320
I work in the Spiriflor Locator Division.

03:50.403 --> 03:51.488
You bastard.

03:52.697 --> 03:55.825
You blabbed to the police that
the culprit was a person made of vines.

03:55.909 --> 03:56.743
What?

03:57.702 --> 04:00.247
It would've been better if we were
able to deal with it on our own.

04:01.081 --> 04:03.333
But if we're trying to catch that thing,

04:03.416 --> 04:05.710
having more people involved
is better, right?

04:05.794 --> 04:08.755
Listen, I understand
that you want to avenge Yomiko.

04:08.838 --> 04:10.298
But listen, Toshiro,

04:10.382 --> 04:12.509
the truth is,
we don't want to kill the culprit.

04:12.592 --> 04:14.844
That's what Transflora Medical decided.

04:14.928 --> 04:16.888
But why? It was…

04:16.972 --> 04:18.348
Hey, low-life.

04:18.431 --> 04:19.808
Before you talk back,

04:19.891 --> 04:22.727
remember who it is
that's paying your salary, okay?

04:23.561 --> 04:25.730
If everything you said is true,

04:26.648 --> 04:28.191
then we want the culprit alive.

04:28.275 --> 04:30.819
It would have incredible
research value for us.

04:31.861 --> 04:33.822
It could be the key to human evolution.

04:34.489 --> 04:38.576
If it's able to live like a human
even after fully turning into a Spiriflor,

04:39.244 --> 04:41.454
then there'd be no reason to remain human,

04:41.538 --> 04:44.582
especially not when we live on a planet
that's deprived of oxygen.

04:45.125 --> 04:46.668
We need to capture it alive

04:46.751 --> 04:49.087
and we need to find it
before the police do.

04:49.838 --> 04:52.507
This has now become our top priority.

04:59.055 --> 05:01.850
I'm Chief Inspector Mine Yatsuka.
Nice to meet you.

05:02.767 --> 05:04.602
Wait. "Yatsuka?"

05:07.439 --> 05:10.900
Akira, I love the suit you have on today.

05:11.860 --> 05:13.445
Read the room, Aunt Mine.

05:14.487 --> 05:16.364
I've compiled all the details of the case.

05:17.198 --> 05:18.950
Given your expertise in Spiriflora,

05:19.034 --> 05:21.745
we would really appreciate your
cooperation in this investigation.

05:21.828 --> 05:23.621
CONFIDENTIAL
OVERVIEW OF IVY SERIAL MURDERS

05:24.164 --> 05:25.332
I have a question.

05:25.415 --> 05:27.709
I see the word "Ivy" in here.
What is that for?

05:27.792 --> 05:29.836
It's the name we're using for the culprit.

05:29.919 --> 05:31.880
It's made of vines
so we're calling it "Ivy."

05:31.963 --> 05:33.757
Seems kinda simple.

05:33.840 --> 05:35.216
Simple is best.

05:35.759 --> 05:36.843
Ivy…

05:40.388 --> 05:41.848
Oh! It's on fire.

05:42.474 --> 05:45.935
Incendiary Bullets, created just for this.

05:46.019 --> 05:47.395
These bullets ignite on impact

05:47.479 --> 05:49.105
and the reason we made them that way

05:49.189 --> 05:51.858
is because we were told the culprit
is a moving Spiriflor.

05:51.941 --> 05:55.445
I will say that we weren't expecting
its whole body to be a Spiriflor,

05:55.528 --> 05:59.574
but, in any case, all officers involved
in this will be carrying these guns.

05:59.657 --> 06:01.242
Wait just a minute, Ms. Yatsuka.

06:01.868 --> 06:04.245
You mean to tell me
your plan is to burn Ivy?

06:04.871 --> 06:07.749
If you do that, we'll never be able
to find out the truth about it.

06:08.375 --> 06:10.251
I understand that you and your team

06:10.335 --> 06:13.380
are seeking answers
about the attack on Ms. Horai.

06:13.463 --> 06:16.299
But preventing further attacks
is more important.

06:17.092 --> 06:18.510
Our officers assigned to this case

06:18.593 --> 06:21.388
will see to it that
Ivy's terminated without fail.

06:21.471 --> 06:23.723
Regardless, let's end this

06:23.807 --> 06:26.059
before the Anti-Transfloration Movement
finds out.

06:29.104 --> 06:31.898
POINTS REGARDING JOINT INVESTIGATION
OF THE IVY SERIAL MURDERS

06:32.357 --> 06:33.691
Don't worry.

06:33.775 --> 06:35.902
I have no intention
of putting you in danger.

06:35.985 --> 06:39.155
ONLY MEMBERS OF THE NATIONAL POLICE HQ
USE INCENDIARY BULLETS

06:48.498 --> 06:52.669
<i>Transflora Medical, Transflora Medical</i>

06:53.420 --> 06:55.088
Meg, how's your studying going?

06:55.588 --> 06:57.507
It's fine. I'll pass my test no problem.

06:57.590 --> 06:58.425
Welcome.

06:59.509 --> 07:01.302
Great. Well, do your best.

07:01.386 --> 07:02.720
In this shitty world,

07:02.804 --> 07:05.056
I want you to be smart enough
to know how to survive.

07:05.640 --> 07:07.225
Okay, I get it, Dad. Stop.

07:07.308 --> 07:09.310
You always say stuff like, uh--

07:11.604 --> 07:13.273
Uh. Oops, my bad.

07:16.401 --> 07:18.695
It fell on the floor.
Don't eat it, all right?

07:18.778 --> 07:20.613
You can have my Mapo Kanten instead.

07:21.406 --> 07:24.117
But that's your food.
I wouldn't wanna take it from you.

07:24.200 --> 07:26.035
It's fine, you can have it, Meg.

07:26.119 --> 07:27.662
Oh, okay, thanks.

07:28.163 --> 07:29.956
You have to pay in advance here.

07:30.039 --> 07:31.583
Are you able to?

07:34.169 --> 07:37.672
<i>Spiro Staffing,</i>
<i>a leading recruitment advertising firm…</i>

07:37.755 --> 07:41.384
That's everything you've got then?
All right, that's what I figured.

07:42.510 --> 07:44.471
All this will get you is soup.

07:45.472 --> 07:48.475
<i>This data is based off surveys that were</i>
<i>conducted during job fairs…</i>

07:48.558 --> 07:50.059
That poor guy.

07:50.143 --> 07:52.228
Dad, I'll give him the food I dropped.

07:53.188 --> 07:55.815
If he's hungry he won't mind.
I'll be right back.

07:55.899 --> 07:56.983
Be careful, okay?

07:57.066 --> 07:59.486
<i>According to the report,</i>
<i>while a majority of students said…</i>

07:59.569 --> 08:00.987
- Excuse me.
- Hmm?

08:02.572 --> 08:04.449
I wondered if you'd want this.

08:05.575 --> 08:07.744
<i>…there were also those</i>
<i>who prioritized…</i>

08:07.827 --> 08:09.370
What are you doing?

08:10.955 --> 08:12.749
It's completely covered in dirt.

08:13.458 --> 08:14.501
Tell me,

08:14.959 --> 08:17.128
would you have offered
that food to your friends?

08:17.712 --> 08:19.130
So you don't want it?

08:22.509 --> 08:23.343
Hey!

08:23.426 --> 08:25.178
It seemed like you guys were hungry.

08:25.845 --> 08:27.096
Don't worry,

08:27.180 --> 08:29.140
you can have as much of it as you want.

08:32.060 --> 08:34.646
One day, you'll be eating
food off the floor, too.

08:34.729 --> 08:36.397
You're no better than us.

08:38.733 --> 08:39.692
I was being nice.

08:39.776 --> 08:41.694
Down with Transfloration!

08:41.778 --> 08:44.155
- Down with the Oxygen tax hike!
- Down with Transfloration!

08:44.614 --> 08:46.908
We're the Anti-Transfloration Movement,

08:46.991 --> 08:50.453
and we will continue to stand against
any increase in the Oxygen Tax!

08:53.289 --> 08:54.415
- Goodnight!
- Oh…

08:55.375 --> 08:56.459
Goodnight.

09:13.226 --> 09:15.019
RESIDENT TAX DEMAND NOTICE

09:15.103 --> 09:17.564
OXYGEN TAX
PAYMENT REMINDER

09:17.647 --> 09:19.148
SCHOOL APPLICATION NOTICE

09:19.232 --> 09:21.568
ADMISSION APPLICATION: 5,000 YEN EACH

09:21.651 --> 09:25.655
SUBMIT AT LEAST THREE APPLICATIONS
TO YOUR HIGH SCHOOL

09:27.365 --> 09:29.867
How am I supposed to pay?
I'm almost broke.

09:33.162 --> 09:34.163
Okay, look,

09:34.247 --> 09:36.749
I want to know why
this thing costs so much money.

09:36.833 --> 09:39.919
I mean, it's just an application
for admission. So why?

09:40.420 --> 09:42.338
Like I've said before, that's the rule.

09:42.422 --> 09:45.091
I'm sorry, I can't afford to pay this.

09:45.883 --> 09:47.927
Well, then maybe
you can ask Meg to get a job

09:48.011 --> 09:49.679
in order to help you out with this.

09:51.514 --> 09:55.184
So my daughter's life will change
all over 15,000 yen?

09:56.686 --> 09:58.146
- Excuse me.
- Huh?

09:58.229 --> 10:01.733
Mr. Okumura, I can cover
the cost for you, if you would like.

10:01.816 --> 10:03.151
Oh. Principal.

10:03.234 --> 10:06.821
You would really do that?

10:06.904 --> 10:08.031
Mm.

10:08.781 --> 10:11.200
I do, however, have one condition for you.

10:12.035 --> 10:13.202
What is it?

10:14.287 --> 10:16.706
ANTI-TRANSFLORATION MOVEMENT
OPINION SHARING MEETING

10:17.290 --> 10:19.834
Transfloration technology
defies the will of God.

10:19.917 --> 10:22.587
Transflora Medical has committed
blasphemy against Him

10:22.670 --> 10:24.464
and is an enemy of the world He created.

10:25.256 --> 10:26.841
- That's right.
- Well said.

10:26.924 --> 10:28.801
All living beings
were born into this world

10:28.885 --> 10:30.928
with their form bestowed upon them by God,

10:31.012 --> 10:32.722
and now this company is changing that.

10:32.805 --> 10:34.807
Transflora Medical is going against it.

10:34.891 --> 10:37.352
This divine order, and they must be
regarded as an enemy.

10:37.435 --> 10:38.353
<i>Jeez.</i>

10:38.436 --> 10:40.146
<i>I just need to hang in there.</i>

10:40.229 --> 10:42.106
<i>I'm doing this for the school application.</i>

10:42.190 --> 10:43.983
Who would like to speak next?

10:44.859 --> 10:47.487
<i>I saw her when I was</i>
<i>visiting the school before.</i>

10:48.237 --> 10:49.989
<i>She's Saito's mother.</i>

10:51.908 --> 10:53.117
I don't have any money.

10:54.160 --> 10:57.205
The Oxygen Tax that we all pay
goes straight into funding

10:57.288 --> 10:59.248
for Transfloration subsidies.

11:00.541 --> 11:01.876
A few days ago,

11:01.959 --> 11:05.254
I watched a special that showed
people who had undergone Transfloration.

11:05.338 --> 11:07.632
Those people were all living it up.

11:07.715 --> 11:09.926
They were purchasing designer goods.

11:10.009 --> 11:11.886
They were eating beef and fresh fruit.

11:12.595 --> 11:13.888
Having fun at Zoomland.

11:13.971 --> 11:16.015
My family has never done
any of those things.

11:16.099 --> 11:20.853
We demand that the Transfloration Board
either abolish or reduce the Oxygen Tax.

11:23.106 --> 11:25.566
I mean, they just get
10 million yen for that?

11:25.650 --> 11:27.777
These people haven't done
anything to deserve it.

11:27.860 --> 11:30.655
We're giving money to people
who are just gonna die.

11:30.738 --> 11:33.533
So what are we working for
if we don't get to keep the money?

11:35.868 --> 11:38.579
The Transfloration Board
has planted a seed in us.

11:38.663 --> 11:40.915
One that has taken root
and feeds on our strength.

11:40.998 --> 11:43.126
It consumes the nutrients that sustain us,

11:43.209 --> 11:44.502
all so that they can bloom.

11:44.585 --> 11:46.587
We are slowly dying under this system.

11:46.671 --> 11:48.673
We, the Anti-Transfloration Movement,

11:48.756 --> 11:52.176
<i>aim to create a world</i>
<i>where humanity can flourish…</i>

11:52.260 --> 11:53.302
THE NATIONAL POLICE HQ PROPERTY

11:53.386 --> 11:54.929
<i>…without relying</i>
<i>on the Transfloration system.</i>

11:55.012 --> 11:58.474
What a bunch of morons.
They're so oblivious to the truth.

11:58.558 --> 11:59.684
Hey, I'm still here.

12:00.184 --> 12:02.854
<i>The Anti-Transfloration Movement</i>
<i>still hasn't found out</i>

12:02.937 --> 12:05.231
<i>the killer is a Spiriflor that can move.</i>

12:05.314 --> 12:07.066
All right. Thank you.

12:07.859 --> 12:10.486
We're going to re-examine the home
of one of the victims.

12:10.570 --> 12:12.655
We have a new lead that seems worthwhile.

12:22.206 --> 12:25.626
After Ivy murdered
Eisuke Hiyama's wife and child,

12:25.710 --> 12:27.211
this is the room it broke into.

12:28.504 --> 12:30.047
It pushed Hiyama out of the window

12:30.131 --> 12:32.175
and then used the same window to escape.

12:32.258 --> 12:35.303
Eisuke Hiyama is still
in critical condition after his fall.

12:35.386 --> 12:38.055
You mean he's still alive then?

12:38.139 --> 12:41.142
We put him through Transfloration
so we could talk to him,

12:41.225 --> 12:43.936
but he immediately went into
Complete Transfloration.

12:48.649 --> 12:49.942
Look at this.

12:50.610 --> 12:52.820
When we found out
that Ivy could climb walls,

12:52.904 --> 12:54.655
we took another look at everything

12:54.739 --> 12:57.700
and discovered marks
on the apartment building's walls.

12:57.784 --> 12:59.577
The marks it made while escaping

12:59.660 --> 13:02.205
were deeper than the ones it made
when it broke in.

13:02.997 --> 13:06.751
Ivy clearly weighed more when it left,
which means it took something from here.

13:06.834 --> 13:09.921
And I'm guessing we were
brought here to find out what it took.

13:28.439 --> 13:30.399
<i>I can hear its voice.</i>

13:30.483 --> 13:32.068
<i>I know I can find it.</i>

13:32.151 --> 13:33.945
<i>So why am I even doing this?</i>

13:39.617 --> 13:42.119
There's something behind here.
Behind this wall.

13:42.203 --> 13:43.204
What?

13:44.372 --> 13:45.414
How can you tell?

13:45.998 --> 13:47.625
Uh… I just can.

13:47.708 --> 13:49.585
It's probably a hidden room.

13:50.044 --> 13:53.923
The reason Ivy attacked the Hiyama family
might be behind that wall.

13:55.091 --> 13:57.009
Didn't I tell you
not to blab to the police

13:57.093 --> 13:58.761
about stuff that you don't need to?

13:58.845 --> 14:01.722
I want Ivy to be killed
so I'm helping them.

14:01.806 --> 14:04.767
Transflora Medical wants to keep it alive.

14:04.851 --> 14:05.977
At least the police are doing--

14:06.060 --> 14:08.604
The police are just using us.
Wasn't that obvious?

14:08.688 --> 14:11.941
The fact that they're the only ones
who are armed with incendiary bullets

14:12.024 --> 14:14.068
while we're unarmed is proof of that.

14:15.361 --> 14:18.990
So we're going to use them too,
to gather information.

14:19.073 --> 14:21.117
I don't care about old-man Kunibe's plan,

14:21.200 --> 14:24.161
but I also don't want to lose
my chance at a promotion.

14:25.121 --> 14:28.124
All right, but how would we
even capture it?

14:28.207 --> 14:30.543
Transflora Medical doesn't have
any troops.

14:30.626 --> 14:33.004
It's pathetic how lame you are.

14:33.087 --> 14:35.756
Everyone's already
taking action on their own.

14:35.840 --> 14:39.176
Kunibe's recruiting soldiers
and paying them with his own money.

14:39.260 --> 14:41.804
I'm currently working
with a military veteran.

14:42.597 --> 14:44.181
So what about you?

14:45.141 --> 14:47.268
How will you help avenge her?

14:51.230 --> 14:52.231
Hello?

14:52.899 --> 14:54.275
<i>Toshiro Kamiya?</i>

14:54.734 --> 14:56.569
<i>We need you at the hospital immediately.</i>

14:56.652 --> 14:59.488
<i>We're going to remove</i>
<i>half of Yomiko Horai's stomach.</i>

15:01.282 --> 15:02.825
<i>Hello? Are you there?</i>

15:06.662 --> 15:08.289
Huh? What are you doing?

15:09.999 --> 15:11.208
We're leaving.

15:11.292 --> 15:12.335
Huh?

15:14.712 --> 15:16.339
The hell is wrong with you?

15:19.216 --> 15:22.386
You clearly don't have a license,
so please stop driving.

15:22.470 --> 15:25.264
Pull the car over! Stop!

15:34.815 --> 15:36.108
That scumbag.

15:50.081 --> 15:50.915
<i>I'm scared.</i>

16:03.636 --> 16:04.679
<i>I'm scared.</i>

16:10.726 --> 16:11.769
Yomiko…

16:32.415 --> 16:34.083
ISHIYONEYAMA

16:47.430 --> 16:49.348
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

16:49.432 --> 16:51.684
- <i>I'll kill you.</i>
- <i>I'll kill you.</i>

16:51.767 --> 16:53.894
- <i>I'll kill you.</i>
- <i>I'll kill you.</i>

16:53.978 --> 16:55.021
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

17:07.033 --> 17:09.243
- <i>You'll regret it.</i>
- <i>I'll kill you.</i>

17:09.326 --> 17:11.704
- <i>You shouldn't do it.</i>
- <i>It's not worth it.</i>

17:11.787 --> 17:13.748
- <i>I hate it.</i>
- <i>How sad.</i>

17:13.831 --> 17:15.541
<i>It's too loud right now.</i>

17:16.292 --> 17:17.376
<i>Calm down.</i>

17:17.460 --> 17:20.379
<i>If I don't, I won't be able</i>
<i>to hear Ivy's bloodlust.</i>

17:21.130 --> 17:22.131
Hmm.

17:22.798 --> 17:23.758
He's clean.

17:23.841 --> 17:24.884
He is, too.

17:24.967 --> 17:27.303
Okay, looks like you didn't take anything.

17:27.386 --> 17:28.387
Have a good night.

17:29.221 --> 17:31.474
What did they suspect us of?

17:31.557 --> 17:35.186
Based on what happened before,
Toshiro might be involved.

17:35.269 --> 17:36.395
You hear from him?

17:36.479 --> 17:37.897
He won't answer.

17:37.980 --> 17:40.524
<i>He hasn't been to work in three days.</i>

17:41.025 --> 17:43.444
- <i>Are you making fun of me?</i>
<i>- I have a child.</i>

17:52.870 --> 17:55.247
<i>You should be taking care of yourself.</i>

17:55.331 --> 17:56.582
<i>Ow. Ow.</i>

17:56.665 --> 17:57.541
<i>Shut up!</i>

17:59.668 --> 18:01.420
<i>I have nothing left to throw up.</i>

18:15.643 --> 18:17.144
It's growing faster.

18:17.228 --> 18:18.687
It's because I used my power.

18:30.032 --> 18:35.162
Yomiko. Yomiko. Yomiko.
Yomiko. Yomiko. Yomiko.

18:40.042 --> 18:43.087
<i>It's okay, it's just crawling around</i>
<i>under my skin a bit.</i>

18:43.587 --> 18:45.840
<i>Calm down. Calm down.</i>

18:49.343 --> 18:51.345
<i>Search for it's bloodlust.</i>

18:55.432 --> 18:57.351
RECEIPT: 35,000 YEN
MARUYOSHI PHARMACY

19:20.833 --> 19:21.750
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

19:23.878 --> 19:26.505
<i>I'll kill you. I'll kill you,</i>
<i>I'll kill you, I'll kill you,</i>

19:26.589 --> 19:28.299
<i>I'll kill you,</i>
<i>I'll kill you, I'll kill you…</i>

19:28.382 --> 19:29.675
<i>…I'll kill you.</i>

19:31.093 --> 19:33.262
Oh. Found him.

19:34.096 --> 19:36.515
I guess he was
near the hospital after all.

19:36.599 --> 19:38.225
<i>Follow him.</i>

19:56.660 --> 19:57.661
Who are you?

19:59.663 --> 20:00.664
That's not it.

20:04.543 --> 20:06.670
Now you're here
to kill me too, aren't you?

20:06.754 --> 20:07.838
Shit.

20:07.922 --> 20:11.175
Do you have any idea
how hard I worked for the gang?

20:11.258 --> 20:13.427
Did you even think about that?

20:13.510 --> 20:15.888
All of you should be grateful!

20:17.389 --> 20:19.892
I think someone needs a nap, don't you?

20:24.939 --> 20:26.523
Hey man, you good?

20:28.817 --> 20:30.402
There are people
at the bottom of the stairs.

20:32.613 --> 20:34.240
Good job, Kanaeno.

20:34.323 --> 20:35.574
Thank you.

20:40.120 --> 20:42.498
Toshiro, what are you doing?

20:43.123 --> 20:46.001
You stole that gun
from the police, didn't you?

20:48.587 --> 20:51.048
You are fired from Transflora Medical.

20:51.131 --> 20:53.050
For disciplinary reasons.

20:55.302 --> 20:56.387
Wait.

20:57.388 --> 20:58.472
No, don't…

20:59.014 --> 21:01.433
Please don't fire me.

21:02.184 --> 21:05.604
I… I took it because
I was going to avenge Yomiko.

21:05.688 --> 21:06.772
I need it!

21:08.274 --> 21:09.358
Please, that gun was…

21:09.441 --> 21:11.193
It's the only way I can…

21:12.736 --> 21:13.862
I've come to my senses.

21:13.946 --> 21:16.365
I'll cooperate with the investigation.

21:16.448 --> 21:19.368
I will capture Ivy for you!
I'll do it your way!

21:20.077 --> 21:22.413
I'm Deputy Chief of Human Resources.

21:22.496 --> 21:24.999
My decision's final
and cannot be overturned.

21:25.082 --> 21:26.792
Goodbye.
